cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "tps-keyboard-layout: Code and results for TPS keyboard layout evaluation and optimization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Dao-Long
    affiliation: National Kaohsiung University of Science and Technology
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/chendaolong1119/tps-keyboard-layout"
abstract: >-
  Corpus-based evaluation and optimization of Taiwanese Phonetic Symbol (TPS,
  方音符號) keyboard layouts for desktop and mobile input. Includes corpus
  extraction from ChhoeTaigiDatabase, TL-to-TPS conversion, a desktop and
  two-thumb phone cost model, simulated annealing and exhaustive search for
  three proposed layouts, the prefix-key symbol page, and all figures.
keywords:
  - Taiwanese Phonetic Symbols
  - Zhuyin
  - keyboard layout
  - text entry
  - mobile input
